{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_045AF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你看到绿咬鹃了吗，Snake？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"怎么样？像蛇吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"蛇？不，我觉得不像蛇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这样啊……果然和羽蛇神不是一回事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"羽蛇神？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"就是玛雅、阿兹特克文明传说中长着羽毛的蛇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"长着羽毛的蛇……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"很奇怪吧？肯定是<R=未确认动物,UMA>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=未确认动物,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Amanda他们说，羽蛇神是把绿咬鹃神格化后的形象，可蛇和鸟怎么可能看错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"反倒可能是有人见过羽蛇神，由他们流传下来的传说在先，在绿咬鹃之前就已经形成了神的形象吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"然后后来发现了长得像那个神的鸟，所以才把它命名为绿咬鹃，我觉得是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"也就是说顺序反了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"依我看，羽蛇神会不会其实是幸存下来的翼龙？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"那样的话，它有翅膀，又是<R=爬行动物,REPTILE>，看起来像蛇也说得通。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬行动物,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"翼龙在非洲至今还有幸存者，被叫做Kongamato、Olitiau之类的名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"既然这样，美洲大陆的翼龙一直活到玛雅、阿兹特克时代，也没什么奇怪的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"幸好没活到现代。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"那可不一定。恐龙据说在6500万年前灭绝，而阿兹特克文明不过是600年前的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"既然都活过6500万年了，怎么可能区区600年就灭绝。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""}]}